# Copy to .env.local and fill in. The key is read only on the server, inside
# app/api/chat/route.ts, and is never sent to the browser.
GEMINI_API_KEY=

# Optional. Any model with function calling works; the app adjusts its request
# to suit the family it is pointed at.
#
#   gemini-3.1-flash-lite  default — the cheapest that is still offered to new
#                          keys and still does function calling
#                          ($0.25 / $1.50 per 1M tokens)
#   gemini-3.6-flash       ~3x the input cost, better at long multi-step tool
#                          runs — switch here if Munshi starts dropping steps
#
# Note: gemini-2.5-flash-lite is no longer issued to new keys, and the 2.5
# family takes a zero thinking budget while the 3.x family rejects one. The
# route works that out from the model name, so either generation just works.
#
GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-3.6-flash
